# Green Camping – Explore Nature Sustainability

## About the Project
Green Camping is a website designed to promote eco-friendly camping and sustainable tourism. It helps users explore nature, discover camping destinations, and learn about responsible travel.

## Features
- Explore beautiful camping destinations.
- Information about eco-friendly camping.
- Sustainable camping tips.
- Travel guidance and important places.
- Simple and user-friendly interface.

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Project Objective
The main objective of this project is to encourage people to explore nature while protecting the environment through sustainable tourism practices.

## Developer
B.Tech – Computer Science and Engineering Student

## Conclusion
Green Camping aims to create awareness about sustainable tourism and encourage people to enjoy nature responsibly.
